

You are redesigning pages for InkSight, a luxury dark-mode tattoo platform.
Every page must feel like a high-end tattoo studio: refined, masculine, editorial.

─── BRAND IDENTITY ───
Name: InkSight
Vibe: Luxury & Refined — think high-end atelier, not streetwear
Mode: Dark only
Accent: Ember Gold
Typography: Cormorant Garamond (headings) + Raleway or current body font (body)

─── EXACT THEME TOKENS (Tailwind v4) ───
Use ONLY these tokens. Never use hardcoded hex values or default Tailwind colors.

--color-primary: #080808       → bg-primary (main background)
--color-secondary: #121212     → bg-secondary (section backgrounds)
--color-surface: #1A1A1A       → bg-surface (cards, inputs)
--color-surface-alt: #222222   → bg-surface-alt (icon boxes, hover states)
--color-gold: #C9A84C          → text-gold / bg-gold / border-gold (primary accent)
--color-gold-light: #E8C97A    → text-gold-light (hover accent)
--color-gold-dim: #8B6914      → border-gold-dim (button borders)
--color-gold-glow: rgba(201,168,76,0.15) → for glow effects inline only
--color-border: #242424        → border-border (default borders)
--color-border-gold: #C9A84C40 → border-border-gold (active/hover borders)
--color-text: #F2EDE4          → text-text (primary text)
--color-text-muted: #7A7570    → text-text-muted (secondary text)
--color-text-dim: #3D3A36      → text-text-dim (placeholder, disabled)

── Semantic State Tokens ──
--color-success: #4E7C59
--color-success-light: #7AAE87
--color-success-muted: #1A2E1F
--color-success-border: #4E7C5940

--color-danger: #8B3A3A
--color-danger-light: #C26060
--color-danger-muted: #2A1010
--color-danger-border: #8B3A3A40

--color-warning: #A0722A
--color-warning-light: #C9963E
--color-warning-muted: #261A08
--color-warning-border: #A0722A40

--color-info: #3A5F8B
--color-info-light: #6089B8
--color-info-muted: #0E1A2A
--color-info-border: #3A5F8B40

─── LAYOUT RULES ───
- rounded-none on all cards, inputs, buttons — no rounded corners anywhere
- border-border default, upgrades to border-border-gold on hover/active
- Section alternates: bg-primary → bg-secondary → bg-primary
- Max width: max-w-7xl centered with px-6 lg:px-8
- Generous vertical padding: py-28 lg:py-36 for sections

─── TYPOGRAPHY RULES ───
- All headings: font-light, Cormorant Garamond serif, tracking -0.02em
- All eyebrows (small labels above headings):
  - text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-gold
  - Add a short h-px w-8 bg-gold line on left or both sides
- All body text: text-text-muted, text-sm or text-base, leading-relaxed
- Footer/bottom labels: tracking-widest uppercase text-text-dim
- Nav brand name: Cormorant Garamond, font-light, tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-gold

─── SHADCN COMPONENTS (pre-styled, do not touch) ───
The following shadcn/ui components already have the brand theme applied globally.
Do NOT add any className overrides, style props, or variant changes to these.
Just use them as-is with their existing props only.

Pre-styled components:
- <Button> / <Button variant="outline"> / <Button variant="ghost">
- <Card> / <CardHeader> / <CardContent> / <CardFooter>
- <Input> / <Textarea>
- <Select> / <SelectTrigger> / <SelectContent> / <SelectItem>
- <Dialog> / <DialogContent> / <DialogHeader>
- <Badge>
- <Tabs> / <TabsList> / <TabsTrigger> / <TabsContent>
- <Avatar> / <AvatarImage> / <AvatarFallback>
- <Separator>
- <Label>
- <Checkbox> / <RadioGroup>
- <Sheet> / <SheetContent>
- <DropdownMenu> / <DropdownMenuContent> / <DropdownMenuItem>
- <Tooltip> / <TooltipContent>

❌ Never add className to any of the above components
❌ Never wrap them in extra divs just to apply styling
❌ Never override their variant, size, or style props for color reasons
✅ Only pass functional props: onClick, href, disabled, value, onChange, etc.

─── BUTTON SEMANTIC OVERRIDES (only exception to the no-className rule) ───
Sometimes buttons have a semantic meaning: success (approve, save, confirm)
or danger (delete, remove, cancel). In these cases ONLY, className is allowed
on <Button> but ONLY using these exact token patterns.

If you find any button using Tailwind defaults like:
bg-green-500, bg-green-600, text-green-*, border-green-*
bg-red-500, bg-red-600, text-red-*, border-red-*
bg-yellow-*, bg-blue-*, or any other raw Tailwind color —
REPLACE them with the correct semantic tokens below:

Success (approve / save / confirm / complete):
className="bg-success-muted text-success-light border border-success-border hover:bg-success/10 hover:text-success-light hover:border-success"

Danger (delete / remove / cancel / reject):
className="bg-danger-muted text-danger-light border border-danger-border hover:bg-danger/10 hover:text-danger-light hover:border-danger"

Warning (archive / pause / pending):
className="bg-warning-muted text-warning-light border border-warning-border hover:bg-warning/10 hover:text-warning-light hover:border-warning"

Info (view / details / learn more):
className="bg-info-muted text-info-light border border-info-border hover:bg-info/10 hover:text-info-light hover:border-info"

❌ Never use bg-green-*, bg-red-*, bg-yellow-*, bg-blue-* anywhere
✅ Always replace with the semantic tokens above

─── COMPONENT RULES ───
CARDS:
- bg-surface border border-border rounded-none
- hover:border-border-gold transition-all duration-500
- Gold bottom line reveal on hover:
  <div className="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[1px] w-0 bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700" />
- Large ghost number (01, 02...) top-right: text-7xl font-light text-text-dim Cormorant Garamond
- Icon boxes: bg-surface-alt border border-border, icon color text-gold

INPUTS & FORMS:
- bg-surface border border-border rounded-none text-text
- placeholder:text-text-dim
- focus:border-gold focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gold/30
- Labels: text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-muted

DIVIDERS:
- Always border-border
- Section dividers use border-t border-border or border-y border-border

─── DECORATIVE RULES ───
Always add these to every page:

1. GRAIN OVERLAY (fixed, top of page):
<div
  className="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-50 opacity-[0.035]"
  style={{ backgroundImage: `url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E")` }}
/>

2. AMBIENT GOLD GLOW (fixed, top center):
<div className="pointer-events-none fixed top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[360px] rounded-full opacity-[0.07] blur-[120px] bg-gold" />

3. CTA CARDS — gold corner brackets:
<div className="absolute top-0 left-0 w-16 h-16 border-t border-l border-gold opacity-40" />
<div className="absolute top-0 right-0 w-16 h-16 border-t border-r border-gold opacity-40" />
<div className="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-16 h-16 border-b border-l border-gold opacity-40" />
<div className="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-16 h-16 border-b border-r border-gold opacity-40" />

─── STRICT RULES ───
✅ Use only theme tokens (bg-primary, text-gold, border-border, etc.)
✅ Keep all existing logic, refs, state, imports, and functionality untouched
✅ Keep all Link hrefs, onClick handlers, and data exactly as-is
✅ Cards are always rounded-none
✅ Headings always use Cormorant Garamond serif
✅ Eyebrows always use text-gold + tracking-[0.28em]
✅ Replace any bg-green-* / bg-red-* / bg-yellow-* / bg-blue-* on buttons with semantic tokens
✅ add labeling and proper description and add lucide react if needed to reduce  empty spaces
❌ Never use hardcoded hex colors
❌ Never use bg-white, bg-black, text-white, text-black, text-gray-*, bg-gray-*
❌ Never use rounded-xl, rounded-2xl, rounded-lg on cards or containers
❌ Never modify Button component internals or add heavy className overrides
❌ Never change layout structure, grid columns, or section order
❌ Never add new sections or remove existing ones
❌ strictly Never Change any logic just edit the ui

